<a href="#S2.SS1.p1.1" title="2.1. Limitations of Current Metrics ‣ 2. Text-to-Big SQL Demands New Metrics ‣ Both Ends Count! Just How Good are LLM Agents at Text-to-“Big SQL”?" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">§2.1</span></a>.
