<div id="A5.p2" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A5.p2.1" class="ltx_p">We then execute the generated SQL queries across different scale factors and average the proposed metrics for all queries. These results are shown in Table <a href="#A5.T6" title="Table 6 ‣ Appendix E Detailed Results ‣ Both Ends Count! Just How Good are LLM Agents at Text-to-“Big SQL”?" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">6</span></a>.</p>
</div>
